{
 "encounter_id": "00929",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I had COVID back in the spring, and I'm still breathless. I thought I'd be back to normal by now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm sorry to hear that, and it's more common than people think. Tell me what the breathlessness is like."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Walking up a hill, or the stairs at work. I have to stop halfway."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Before COVID, could you manage those without any trouble?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Easily. I used to run five kilometres on a Saturday."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you coughing, or bringing anything up?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A dry cough, now and again. Nothing much."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain, wheeze, or swelling in your legs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain. No wheeze. My legs are fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever, or night sweats?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you taking any medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A blue inhaler, salbutamol, two puffs, when I need it, and vitamin D, 1000 units a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does the inhaler help? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not really. I don't notice a difference. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any past medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, controlled with diet, and an appendix removal when I was twenty."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And how were you treated for COVID? Were you in hospital? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I managed at home. But it was a rough fortnight. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. I'd like to listen to your chest, and check your oxygen when you walk. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay.",
   "pause": 16.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your chest sounds clear, with good air entry on both sides. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So nothing wrong? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nothing obvious on listening. I'd like to arrange a chest X-ray, and a breathing test called spirometry, to check how your lungs are working."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When can I have those? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Both within two weeks. I'll arrange them today. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And will I get better? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Most people do, but it can take months. Pace yourself, and build up gentle walking a little each week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll try. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in three weeks, with the results in hand."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks. Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
